{
  "name": "HL · Support inbox triage",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL · Support inbox triage (Lesson 3.7)\nNew support email → trim → Text Classifier (5 categories + Other) → per route: extract fields, draft a reply into Gmail (never sent), alert Tolu on Telegram for complaints, refunds and Other, label spam \"Spam?\" (never deleted).\n\n**Credentials:** Gmail OAuth2 (Gmail Trigger and the three Gmail nodes) · OpenAI (all six chat model sub-nodes; or swap in your provider's model) · Telegram API (three Telegram nodes).\n**Placeholders:** YOUR_MODEL (each chat model: pick a small model for classifier and extractors), YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID, YOUR_SHEET_ID (Order requests tab), YOUR_SPAM_LABEL_ID (Gmail label \"Spam?\").\n\nUse a **test inbox** while building. Connect Settings → Error workflow to HL · Error alerts, then publish.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "f428add3-ce19-4b04-b584-d5b18adb9b48",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
