    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Score before you go live\nRun **Test set (12 emails)** (Execute workflow → choose that trigger) and read each Text Classifier output against the expected field. Before running, deactivate the nodes after the classifier (select, press D) so the fake emails don't create drafts, labels or alerts.\n\nScore in Card 4. Don't go on until there are **no critical misses**: a complaint or refund that doesn't reach Tolu, or a real email marked spam.\n\nChat models: temperature 0 for classifier and extractors, 0.3 for drafts. Outputs: order · complaint · refund · enquiry · spam · Other.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "bf31034b-f85d-4585-b3c9-c4b45fd72ace",
      "name": "Scoring the test set",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -528,
        396
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI sorts and drafts; people decide\n- Drafts are created in Gmail, never sent. Tolu reviews and sends.\n- Refunds: Telegram to Tolu only. No node here pays, refunds or deletes.\n- Spam: labelled Spam?, never deleted.\n- The extractor must never invent an order number (\"Never invent one\").\n\nGmail draft: if your output shows no threadId on the trigger, remove the Thread ID option; the draft still goes to the sender.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 400
      },
      "id": "c281ce30-97bc-42b9-aa01-defd6c48c4a6",
      "name": "People stay in charge",
